Composes arguments for a function. Prepends partials to provided arguments at specified placeholder indexes. Returns the new composed argument array.

@private
@param {Array} args The provided arguments.
@param {Array} partials The arguments to prepend.
@param {Array} holders The placeholder indexes in partials.
@param {boolean} [isCurried] Whether composing for a curried function.
@returns {Array} The composed arguments.

@example
// Each day between October 6 and October 10, 2014:
var result = eachDayOfInterval({
  start: new Date(2014, 9, 6),
  end: new Date(2014, 9, 10)
})
//=> [
//   Mon Oct 06 2014,
//   Tue Oct 07 2014,
//   Wed Oct 08 2014,
//   Thu Oct 09 2014,
//   Fri Oct 10 2014
// ]

@example

// Each day between 6 October 2014 and 10 October 2014:
var result = eachDayOfInterval({
  start: new Date(2014, 9, 6),
  end: new Date(2014, 9, 10)
})
//=> [
//   Mon Oct 06 2014 00:00:00,
//   Tue Oct 07 2014 00:00:00,
//   Wed Oct 08 2014 00:00:00,
//   Thu Oct 09 2014 00:00:00,
//   Fri Oct 10 2014 00:00:00
// ]

@example
// Each quarter within the interval 6 February 2014 - 10 August 2014:
var result = eachQuarterOfInterval({
  start: new Date(2014, 1, 6),
  end: new Date(2014, 7, 10)
})
// => [
//   Wed Jan 01 2014 00:00:00,
//   Tue Apr 01 2014 00:00:00,
//   Tue Jul 01 2014 00:00:00
// ]

